  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One iteration",
      "items": [
        "Fit: large tool results are cut; if the conversation is still too big, old turns are summarised (compaction, with a light model) or dropped. The member's latest message and the current run's calls are never dropped.",
        "Model turn: the gateway streams text (and reasoning for models set to show it) and tool calls. The stop flag is polled while text streams.",
        "Tool calls: reads of one turn run in parallel (up to 8); writes and ask_member run one at a time. Results go back as quoted <data> blocks and the loop repeats."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Termination (run statuses)",
      "items": [
        "completed: a turn with no tool calls.",
        "tool_limit: after 25 counted calls tools are withdrawn, so the next turn must answer.",
        "cancelled: the member pressed stop (checked between calls and while streaming).",
        "failed: provider/LLM error, an API refusal (no model, budget, internal-only) or a context window too small.",
        "Asked (jobs only): ask_member saves a checkpoint and pauses the job until the member answers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Extras on the way out",
      "items": [
        "Structured answer: after suggest_kpis, one more model call restates the answer as validated JSON cards (structured.py).",
        "Verify (jobs): after a write tool, run_validation checks the proposals; with errors the loop is asked to fix them, up to verify.max_rounds.",
        "Tool search: with more than 30 tools only core tools plus find_tools are offered."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Simplified",
      "items": [
        "Prompted mode (models without native tool calling) parses one JSON tool request per reply instead (prompted.py); same loop.",
        "The supervisor/specialist mode for jobs runs this same loop for each specialist (supervisor.py); not drawn separately."
      ]
    }
  ]
